# ── The live vault — client data. Never committed. ───────────────────────────
#
# The BLANK versions of these live in _skeleton/ and ARE tracked.
# System/Scripts/install-skeleton.sh copies _skeleton/ into place on deploy.
#
# Before adding anything here, ask: is it a blank form, or a filled-in one?
# Blank forms belong in _skeleton/. Filled-in ones belong on this list.
#
Brain/
Personality/
Goals/

# ── Per-install config and runtime state ─────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: git does NOT support trailing comments on a pattern line — the comment
# becomes part of the pattern and the rule silently matches nothing. Comments
# go on their own line, always.
#
# written by /setup — the client's own tech stack:
System/integrations.yaml
# mutated at runtime as flows get scheduled:
System/Scheduled_Flows.md
System/.setup_progress
System/Logs/
System/Health_Reports/*.md
!System/Health_Reports/README.md
Dashboards/data/

# ── Runtime junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp

# ── Mac and Obsidian system files ────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.obsidian/
